SUMMARY:June Bug Big Barn Bash
DESCRIPTION:Our June Bug Big Barn Bash is coming up!! \nJoin us @hickorynutgap + @hngfarmstore for an epic day celebrating pollinators! We have so much in store.\n FREE Hayrides Bug Crawl with HNG Puppet Show by @noquisiinitiative Shop Local Makers Dine With @thegardenavl Coffee + Goodies @roamavl Snack With @appalachianpopco Raffle For @noquisiinitiative Live Bluegrass Jam+ MORE!!\n\nLive Bluegrass Jam – Enjoy Live Music – Our good friend & master musician John Templeton of Old Charlotte Highwaymen will be hosting an open jam session at every Big Barn Market this season. Kick it off THIS SUNDAY with him and some buds\, play acoustic old time\, bluegrass\, whatever tunes folks want to play.
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/3rd-annual-hickory-spring-bash/
LOCATION:Hickory Nut Gap Farm Fairview
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Fairview,Live Music,Open MIc/Jam
END:VEVENT
