CREATED:20260624T104704Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260624T104706Z
UID:10047193-1782568800-1782579600@livemusicasheville.com
SUMMARY:Live Brazilian Roda
DESCRIPTION:  \n\n\n\nAn urban musical event that grew out of the traditional Samba de Roda\, becoming a symbol of Brazilian identity in cities like Rio de Janeiro.\n\n\n\n\n\n\nMusicians and singers gather in a circle to play instruments such as the pandeiro\, cavaquinho\, and tantan.\n\n\n\n\n\n\nIt is a communal and inclusive event where everyone joins in singing\, clapping\, and dancing to the music.\n\n\n\n\n\n\nIt embodies the spirit of Brazilian culture\, with no barrier between performers and the audience. \n\n\n\n  \n\n\nA BEVERAGE FOR EVERY TYPE \n\n\n\n\n\nAn array of beverage options makes Archetype an approachable taproom for everyone – from handmade cocktails to carefully curated wines\, rotating house-made hard seltzers\, plenty of non-alcoholic and gluten free beers\, ciders\, local sodas\, seltzer waters\, regular and CBD kombucha\, and of course\, Archetype’s own award winning beers. Plus\, thanks to our amazing Beacham’s Curve courtyard\, you can order and enjoy food brought right to your table. The sun drenched plant-filled taproom is cozy\, modern\, and equipped with board games\, coloring sheets\, Nintendo\, a jukebox box\, couches\, covered patios and a rooftop deck. We’re just up the hill from RAD – with plenty of parking! archetypebrewing.com \n\n\n\n 
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/live-brazilian-roda-2-3/
LOCATION:Archetype Brewing\, 265 Haywood\, Asheville\, NC\, 28806\, United States
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music,Open MIc/Jam
GEO:35.578181;-82.575074
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Archetype Brewing 265 Haywood Asheville NC 28806 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=265 Haywood:geo:-82.575074,35.578181
END:VEVENT
