SUMMARY:Celtic Festival
DESCRIPTION:Join us on Saturday\, June 27 from 3–7 PM for our 4th Celtic Festival\, an afternoon filled with music\, community\, and great beer!\n Live performances by talented local Celtic musicians Open Irish Sessions – bring your instrument and join in! Fresh craft beer and beautiful mountain views\nWhether you’re Irish by heritage or simply Irish at heart\, come celebrate with us and enjoy an evening of traditional tunes\, good company\, and Turgua hospitality.
